## Third-party software

### Archify (C4 diagram rendering)

The **ingest** Docker image installs [Archify](https://github.com/tt-a1i/archify)
at `/opt/archify` (pinned release; see `ARG ARCHIFY_VERSION` in
`services/ingest/Dockerfile`). Ariadne invokes it as an external CLI
(`validate`, `deliver`, `compare`); mapper code in this repository is original
and is not a copy of Archify sources.

